<title>FRANCE: Iran buys 50,000 T optional barley - traders.</title>
<headline>Iran buys 50,000 T optional barley - traders.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iran has bought 50,000 tonnes of optional-origin feed barley at around $130 per tonne, fob, European grain traders said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The two cargoes of 25,000 tonnes each are for shipment in May, they said.</p>
</text>
